KNOWNBUG itanium-abi
main.cpp
--cpp20
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* no_unique_address: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
The front end ignored the attribute and laid out the empty member as a
byte, so sizeof(S) was 8.
Tagged itanium-abi: Visual Studio ignores [[no_unique_address]] (it has
[[msvc::no_unique_address]]), which [intro.object]/8 permits, and so does
cbmc's Visual Studio mode.
